  message: "Re-surfaced in dogfooding tranche 10 (U19, F193.A2, severity 2). confidence_model='hypergumbo-evidence-v1' omits the spec-§1706-mandated .MINOR component — exactly this item. Fix: emit ...-vMAJOR.MINOR per §1706 (schema.py:74)."  # 9d9e
